# CQX v0.1 examples — the # headings here are explanatory section separators,
# not part of the CQX language. Treat each message separately.

# Basic message
你好 [@123456]！看看这张图片：[img cat.png]

# Reply and mixed media
[reply 903][@123] 给你这张图：[img "https://a.test/p?q=[1,2]&x=3"]

# Forward tree
[forward]
  [msg user=10001 name="Alice"]你好！[face 14][/msg]
  [msg user=10002 name="Bob"]第一行
第二行[/msg]
  [msg id=987654/]
[/forward]

# A vendor extension
[:vendor.card title="今日菜单"]
  [:vendor.button label="查看" action="open_menu"/]
[/vendor.card]

# Literal CQX markup in a text message
字面量：\[@123] 与 \[img cat.png]
